flowchart TB
  subgraph Interfaces[Two supported interfaces]
    E[Official evaluator] -->|reset and respond| AC[Strict Agent contract]
    U[Local shopper] --> UI[React experience]
    UI -->|same-origin JSON| API[Loopback FastAPI adapter]
    API -->|server-owned sessions and turns| AC
  end

  subgraph Core[Offline-first retrieval core]
    AC --> S[Typed conversation state]
    S --> R{Evidence-aware route activation}
    R --> F[Field-weighted SQLite FTS5]
    R --> X[Structured facet maps]
    R --> D[256D catalog-derived vectors]
    R --> P[Optional profile prior]
    F --> WRF[Weighted reciprocal-rank fusion]
    X --> WRF
    D --> WRF
    P --> WRF
    WRF --> H[Confidence-aware filters and top-100 rerank]
    H --> C[Clarification, diversity, unseen rotation]
    C --> V[Deterministic output validator]
  end

  V -->|official schema| E
  V -->|nested official response| API
  API --> DM[Snapshot metadata, quick replies, diagnostics]
  DM --> UI

  UI -. explicit consent for one Hybrid session .-> O[Bounded OpenAI enhancement]
  S -. consented distilled state .-> O
  H -. at most 30 valid candidates .-> O
  O -. validated blended order .-> H
  O -. missing key, timeout, or invalid output .-> H

  SNAP[Fixed 50,000-item TechJam snapshot] --> F
  SNAP --> X
  SNAP --> D
  UI -. user-initiated verification only .-> AMZ[Amazon ASIN search]

  subgraph Future[Public-product gates, not implemented]
    LIVE[Licensed live catalog and inventory]
    AUTH[Authentication, tenant isolation, privacy]
    OPS[Deployment, rate limits, monitoring, recovery]
    GOV[Commerce, affiliate, security, accessibility review]
  end
